OL,3,ASerious pollution by water industry
OL,4,Aremains high despite #5bn investment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe environmental performance of water
OL,7,Fcompanies worsened again last year
OL,8,Fdespite industry investment, according
OL,9,Fto the first joint report by the
OL,10,Fregulators.
OL,12,FEight of the nine companies in England
OL,13,Fwere rated as "poor" or "requiring
OL,14,Fimprovement", with only Severn Trent
OL,15,Freceiving the highest rating.
OL,17,FCompanies were praised for reducing
OL,18,Fservice disruptions but serious
OL,19,Fpollution into the environment remained
OL,20,Fa "major concern".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
