OL,3,ASerious pollution by water industry
OL,4,Aremains high despite #5bn investment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chair of the environmental
OL,7,Fregulator, Alan Lovell, said the
OL,8,Fresults showed the industry continued
OL,9,Fto "fall well short of the standards
OL,10,Frightly demanded by both us and the
OL,11,Fpublic".
